[Name] GnomeSession
[Summary] GNOME session manager
[License] GPL-2.0-or-later
[Homepage] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-session
[Description] Runs pantheon / pantheon-wayland sessions. 45.0 pinned for -Dsystemd=false support (46+ require libsystemd); falls back to the legacy session manager on sysvinit.
